title: "原 ACK 续接与同页恢复的验证边界"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: 违例
    lg1: 已停止或等待
    lg2: 执行中
    lg3: Breaks AtMostOneContinuationDispatch
    lg4: Path to the AtMostOneContinuationDispatch bug
  }
  class lg0 pink
  class lg1 yellow
  class lg2 blue
  class lg3 breaks
  class lg4 bugPath
  s0: 核对原请求和完整 ACK
  s1: 独立续接决定已审阅
  s2: 本阶段待派发
  s3: 本阶段已派发一次
  s4: 没有原 ACK#65292;结果未知
  s5: 违反#65306;未知续接请求被重复派发
  [*] --> s0
